{"ID":"20231122152527-5op3lf5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20231122152527-5op3lf5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122152527-5op3lf5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122155713-t3x583b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122155713-edwve1u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2091,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122155713-edwve1u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:63,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:63\u0026#125;","title":"第十六篇 诊要经终论","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231122155713-t3x583b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-t3x583b","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【本篇要点】"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-6u86m0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-6u86m0y","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一:指出针刺治疗应结合四时气候,而有轻重深浅的分寸.因为天气、地气、人气是密切关联的,如果违反了这个规律,非但不能愈病,反而会造成不良后果."}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-cp7c129","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-cp7c129","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二:针刺胸腹部位,要注意避免误伤五脏,并指出了避免的方法和误伤五脏的死期.说明只有了解内在脏器的部位以及正确掌握针刺的手法,才能避免医疗事故的发生."}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-hp6mg2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-hp6mg2o","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三:十二经脉气绝的症状."}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-rbm5gkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-rbm5gkg","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原文与译文】"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-adz300m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-adz300m","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝问曰：诊要何如?"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-d7d4855","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-d7d4855","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝问道：诊病的重要关键是什麽?"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-89ho7tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-89ho7tw","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯对曰：正月二月，天气始方，地气始发，人气在肝。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-4p3dc0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-4p3dc0c","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯回答说：重要点在于天、地、人相互之间的关系。如正月、二月，天气开始有一种生发的气象，地气也开始萌动，这时候的人气在肝;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-8h40mbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-8h40mbg","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三月四月天气正方，地气定发，人气在脾。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-yl3j5kw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-yl3j5kw","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三月、四月，天气正当明盛，地气也正是华茂而欲结实，这时候的人气在脾;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-k5m6g6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-k5m6g6z","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五月六月天气盛，地气高，人气在头。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-lz8zxxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-lz8zxxi","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五月、六月，天气盛极，地气上升，这时候的人气在头部;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-se0cz6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-se0cz6y","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七月八月阴气始杀，人气在肺。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-rykzak5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-rykzak5","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七月、八月，阴气开始发生肃杀的现象，这时候的人气在肺;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-0bsk7ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-0bsk7ux","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九月十月阴气始冰，地气始闭，人气在心。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-ykc2loh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-ykc2loh","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九月、十月，阴气渐盛，开始冰冻，地气也随着闭藏，这时候的人气在心;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-oglhqm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-oglhqm5","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十一月十二月冰复，地气合，人气在肾。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-v10b821","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-v10b821","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十一月、十二月，冰冻更甚而阳气伏藏，地气闭密，这时候的人气在肾。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-9xsjqv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-9xsjqv5","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故春刺散俞，及与分理，血出而止。甚者传气，间者环也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-imfkwzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-imfkwzb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由于人气与天地之气皆随顺阴阳之升沉，所以春天的刺法，应刺经脉俞穴，及于分肉腠理，使之出血而止，如病比较重的应久留其针，其气传布以后才出针，较轻的可暂留其针，候经气循环一周，就可以出针了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-805bvat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-805bvat","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏刺络俞，见血而止。尽气闭环，痛病必下。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-kfyxebv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-kfyxebv","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏天的刺法，应刺孙络的俞穴，使其出血而止，使邪气尽去，就以手指扪闭其针孔伺其气行一周之顷，凡有痛病，必退下而愈。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-rkcy5cb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-rkcy5cb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋刺皮肤循理，上下同法，神变而止。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-kkzzk7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-kkzzk7l","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋天的刺法应刺皮肤，顺着肌肉之分理而刺，不论上部或下部，同样用这个方法，观察其神色转变而止。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-zv8llsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-zv8llsc","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬刺俞窍于分理，甚者直下，间者散下。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-ro50ju1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-ro50ju1","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬天的刺法应深取俞窍于分理之间，病重的可直刺深入，较轻的，可或左右上下散布其针，而稍宜缓下。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-djzvblb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-djzvblb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春夏秋冬，各有所刺，法其所在。春刺夏分，脉乱气微，入淫骨髓，病不能愈，令人不嗜食，又且少气。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-6otivra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-6otivra","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春夏秋冬，各有所宜的刺法，须根据气之所在，而确定刺的部位。如果春天刺了夏天的部位，伤了心气，可使脉乱而气微弱，邪气反而深入，浸淫于骨髓之间病就很难治愈，心火微弱，火不生土，有使人不思饮食，而且少气了;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-gml0x5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-gml0x5n","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春刺秋分，筋挛逆气环为咳嗽，病不愈，令人时惊，又且哭。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-9vwuxej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-9vwuxej","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春天刺了秋天的部位，伤了肺气，春病在肝，发为筋挛，邪气因误刺而环周于肺，则又发为咳嗽，病不能愈，肝气伤，将使人时惊，肺气伤，且又使人欲哭;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-ek4fsuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-ek4fsuc","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春刺冬分，邪气着藏，令人胀，病不愈，又且欲言语。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-8gkd4z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-8gkd4z3","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春天刺了冬天的部位，伤了肾气，以致邪气深着于内脏，使人胀满，其病不但不愈，肝气日伤，而且使人多欲言语。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-mr8qpzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-mr8qpzu","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏刺春分，病不愈，令人解堕。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-cbm4hhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-cbm4hhb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏天刺了春天的部位，伤了肝气，病不能愈，反而使人精力卷怠;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-yjaw1wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-yjaw1wc","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏刺秋分，病不愈，令人心中欲无言，惕惕如人将捕之。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-89qful6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-89qful6","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏天刺了秋天的部位，伤了肺气，病不能愈，反而使人肺气伤而声不出，心中不欲言，肺金受伤，肾失其母，故虚而自恐，惕惕然好象被逮捕的样子;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-26o0nok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-26o0nok","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏刺冬分，病不愈，令人少气，时欲怒。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-l7nr50v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-l7nr50v","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏天刺了冬天的不位，伤了肾气，病不能愈，反而使精不化气而少气，水不涵木而时常要发怒。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-jwt0fkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-jwt0fkq","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋刺春分，病不已，令人惕然，欲有所为，起而忘之。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-f0avahn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-f0avahn","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋天刺了春天的部位，伤了肝气，病不能愈，反而使人血气上逆，惕然不宁，且又善忘;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-nvgz47b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-nvgz47b","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋刺夏分，病不已，令人益嗜卧，且又善梦。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-6xdxb3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-6xdxb3p","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋天刺了夏天的部位，伤了心气，病不能愈，心气伤，火不生土，反而使人嗜卧，心不藏神，又且多梦;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-7667qjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-7667qjj","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋刺冬分，病不已，令人洒洒时寒。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-s25pyhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-s25pyhs","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋天刺了冬天的部位，伤了肾气，病不能愈，凡使人肾不闭藏，血气内散，时时发冷。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-v1074p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-v1074p2","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬刺春分，病不已，令人欲卧不能眠，眠而有见。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-cwma2fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-cwma2fm","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬天刺了春天的部位，伤了肝气，病不能愈，肝气少，魂不藏，使人困倦而又不得安眠，即便得眠，睡中如见怪异等物;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-crq3789","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-crq3789","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬刺夏分，病不愈，气上发为诸痹。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-qq0t585","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-qq0t585","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬天刺了夏天的部位，伤了心气，病不能愈，反使人脉气发泄，而邪气闭痹于脉，发为诸痹;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-2q1c7v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-2q1c7v2","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬刺秋分，病不已，令人善渴。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-owk7ccw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-owk7ccw","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬天刺了秋天的部位，伤了肺气，病不能愈，化源受伤，凡使人常常作渴。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-bc69hga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-bc69hga","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡刺胸腹者，必避五脏。中心者环死，中脾者五日死，中肾者七日死，中肺者五日死。中膈者，皆为伤中，其病虽愈，不过一岁必死。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-fzz5kxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-fzz5kxv","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡于胸腹之间用针刺，必须注意避免刺伤了五脏。假如中伤了心脏，经气环身一周便死;假如中伤了脾脏，五日便死;假如中伤了肾脏，七日便死;假如中伤了肺脏，五日便死;假如中伤隔膜的，皆为伤中，当时病虽然似乎好些，但不过一年其人必死。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-ioz4eos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-ioz4eos","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺避五脏者，知逆从也。所谓从者，膈与脾肾之处，不知者反之。刺胸腹者，必以布憿着之，乃从单布上刺，刺之不愈复刺。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-sygzjeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-sygzjeg","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺胸腹注意避免中伤五脏，主要是要知道下针的逆从。所谓从，就是要明白膈和脾肾等处，应该避开;如不知其部位不能避开，就会刺伤五脏，那就是逆了。凡刺胸腹部位，应先用布巾覆盖其处，然后从单布上进刺。如果刺之不愈，可以再刺，这样就不会把五脏刺伤了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-yaza2vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-yaza2vb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺针必肃，刺肿摇针，经刺勿摇，此刺之道也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-jw96bgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-jw96bgl","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在用针刺治病的时候，必须注意安静严肃，以候其气;如刺脓肿的病，可以用摇针手法以出脓血;如刺经脉的病，就不要摇针。这是刺法的一般规矩。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-57oscnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-57oscnt","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：愿闻十二经脉之终奈何?"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-678vqg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-678vqg4","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝问道：请你告诉我使二经气绝的情况是怎样的?"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-1fmvqpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-1fmvqpm","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：太阳之脉，其终也戴眼，反折瘈瘲，其色白，绝汗乃出，出则死矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-vibdqpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-vibdqpb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯回答说：太阳经脉气绝的时候，病人两目上视，身背反张，手足抽掣，面色发白，出绝汗，绝汗一出，便要死亡了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-bjnavmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-bjnavmz","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少阳终者，耳聋、百节皆纵，目寰绝系。绝系一日半死，其死也色先青，白乃死矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-7arrqwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-7arrqwq","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少阳经脉气绝的时候，病人耳聋，遍体骨节松懈，两目直视如惊，到了目珠不转，一日半便要死了;"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-aeua8yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-aeua8yg","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳明终者，口目动作，善惊、妄言、色黄。其上下经盛，不仁则终矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-1w8b0mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-1w8b0mc","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临死的时候，面色先见青色，再由青色变为白色，就死亡了。阳明经脉气绝的时候，病人口眼牵引歪斜而困动，时发惊惕，言语胡乱失常，面色发黄，其经脉上下所过的部分，都表现出盛燥的症状，由盛燥而渐至肌肉麻木不仁，便死亡了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-yulaxjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-yulaxjb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少阴终者，面黑齿长而垢，腹胀闭，上下不通而终矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-b8vfajj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-b8vfajj","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少阴经脉气绝的时候，病人面色发黑，牙龈收削而牙齿似乎变长，并积满污垢，腹部胀闭，上下不相通，便死亡了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-3tgakv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-3tgakv2","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阴终者，腹胀闭，不得息，善噫善呕，呕则逆，逆则面赤，不逆则上下不通，不通则面黑，皮毛焦而终矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-c25x2vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-c25x2vi","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阴经脉气绝的时候，，腹胀闭塞，呼吸不利，常欲嗳气，并且呕吐，呕则气上逆，气上逆则面赤，假如气不上逆，又变为上下不通，不通则面色发黑，皮毛枯樵而死了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-o59gakb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-o59gakb","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厥阴终者，中热溢干，善溺、心烦、甚则舌卷，卵上缩而终矣。此十二经之所败也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122155713-edwve1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122155713-edwve1u","updated":"20231122155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厥阴经脉气绝的时候，病人胸中发热，咽喉干燥，时时小便，心胸烦躁，渐至舌卷，睾丸上缩，便要死了。以上就是十二经脉气绝败坏的症候。"}]}]}